  "youtube": {
    "description": "it's 2001. the tunnel lights are flickering, the walls are close and you can't hear anyone behind you. 🏁\nY2K drum & bass in the spirit of Rollcage Stage II and the PS1 racing era: breakbeats, rolling bass and that late 90s / early 2000s game soundtrack energy.\n\nPut it on for driving, gaming, coding, studying or just staring out the window pretending you're in a loading screen.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nTRACKLIST\n00:00 Sector Three Run\n01:54 Torque\n04:06 Pressure Loop\n06:17 Traction Sprint\n08:29 Furnace\n10:41 Flywheel Circuit\n12:52 Boost Stage\n15:05 Iron\n17:16 Sump Circuit\n19:25 Lost Bulkhead\n21:36 Electric Conveyor\n23:46 Broken Foundry\n25:56 Redline Circuit\n28:05 Cold Momentum\n30:17 Deep Kickdown\n32:27 Exhaust Run\n34:39 Gantry Line\n36:50 Lost Slag\n39:01 Rivet Approach\n41:12 Inertia Drive\n43:23 Turbine\n45:35 Hollow Downforce\n47:46 Lap Record Sprint\n49:56 Piston\n52:06 Wheelspin Loop\n54:15 Blackout\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🏎️ Visuals: Digital Aura Racing Team\n🎛️ Music: original tracks generated with custom Python scripts\n💿 Inspired by the sound of Rollcage Stage II and classic PS1 racers. Not affiliated with or endorsed by the original game or its publishers.\n\nIf this takes you back, drop your favourite old racing game in the comments and subscribe for more Y2K DnB.\n\n#y2kdnb #drumandbass #ps1",
